    "window_expansion_coercivity_restoration": "Expanding the spatial window to [4, 40] and [2, 100] accumulates greater prime-power station density and larger Archimedean spectral mass, shifting the transition threshold outward. On [4, 40], positive definiteness is preserved at h=1.00 (lambda_min = +0.511 > 0), and on [2, 100], coercivity is even stronger (lambda_min = +2.322 > 0 at h=1.00).",
